    "turn_text": "Senator, I just love that. All of that so much. At the age of 12, you lost your father. And his dying words to you were, quote, make me proud. And ultimately, we all want to do that, want to make our parents and our loved ones proud of us. And I'm sure your dad would be very proud of you. But how have those words, the words of your father, steered the course of your life?",
