        "text": "The military policy required service women stationed in Saudi Arabia to wear an Abaya when traveling off base.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "An Abaya is a body covering.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "This lawsuit was significant for female service members.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
