        "text": "Female service members have a right to bodily autonomy and personal dignity in military settings.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Forcing women to wear religious or cultural garments against their will constitutes a violation of rights.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Military policies should accommodate gender equality and individual conscience.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker's experience reflects broader concerns shared by other female service members.",
        "confidence": 0.89
