    "turn_text": "Now it's that time, my favorite time of the week, time to crown our Probomedical Myth Week. The crown goes to... Mary Ball Washington, George Washington's mom. Wait, Virginia, is there something ironic about giving a crown to George Washington's mom? How so? Oh, he didn't want to be a king.",
